GPL-2.0 code in the /demo bundle
--------------------------------

The browser demo at /demo runs the ROM in serverboy 0.0.7 by Daniel Shumway
(https://gitlab.com/piglet-plays/serverboy.js), which is built on the
GameBoy-Online emulator core by Grant Galitz. Both are licensed under the GNU
General Public License, version 2 (see web/node_modules/serverboy/LICENSE after
`pnpm install`).

Vite bundles serverboy into its own chunk (dist/assets/gameboy-*.js). That
chunk is distributed under the terms of GPL-2.0, not MIT. Its complete
corresponding source is the serverboy package on npm (version pinned in
web/pnpm-lock.yaml) and upstream at the GitLab link above, together with the
glue code in web/src/emu/ in this repository. The rest of kagiboy only talks
to the emulator; it is not derived from it and stays MIT.


